Didn't you read the original post? stone-to-flesh on a statue of a stone 
golem creates a meatball.

BTW, hitting a pet flesh golem with a cockatrice corpse doesn't seem to 
count as an attack, at least not when I just tried it.

So the only way I can think of to 'resurrect' Satchel is (and I tested it 
in wizard mode, so I know it works):

Break the statue so you get a pile of rocks
Cast stone-to-flesh on the rocks to get a pile of meatballs
Polypile the meatballs (probably getting food rations)
Keep polypiling until you get a straw golem
Charm the straw golem (easier than charming a stone golem)
Name it 'Satchel'
Hit Satchel with a cockatrice corpse.

Personally I'd just engrave 'Erected in memory of Satchel' in front of the 
statue and go off in search of another pet.


